  "description": "Client for a host app to use CircleAI's shared on-device brain. Detects the\n      installed standalone service, binds it, and asks a turn over the authorized\n      cross-app link — the person approves the link once with device auth, and from\n      then the app calls the one shared brain instead of shipping its own model.\n      A host app must declare a <queries> entry for the CircleAI package\n      (Android 11+ package visibility) to see and bind the service.",
